  "notes": [
    "Purchase date ranges are filtered locally after verified pagination.",
    "Payment receipt list returns JsonNode because its response schema is not published in the supplied sources.",
    "Invoice batch response preserves vendor fields through ApiModel.",
    "Accounts payable due_date_end/date_end discrepancy requires explicit caller choice.",
    "JournalService.getJournalsByDate filters journal.date locally after verified pagination. Live test 2026-11-18 observed remote date_start/date_end (date-only and RFC3339) and document_id ignored; name respected. Raw journal list methods retain server behavior.",
    "Journal filter investigation 2026-11-18: 14 encoded SDK URLs matched independent JDK HTTP responses. Date ranges and numeric document_id did not restrict results; name worked. The official narrative mentions document_id but the interactive schema omits it. Document-date LocalDate overloads now emit UTC RFC3339 boundaries; String values remain explicit. Internal server cause unconfirmed."
  ]
}
